## Repository Structure

```text
agentcertify/
├── agentcertify/
│   ├── core/           # Mathematical optimization & multi-agent cascade bounds
│   ├── scoring/        # Shannon entropy, logprobs & JSON schema verifiers
│   ├── runtime/        # Execution interceptors & fallback handlers
│   ├── wrappers/       # Adapter layer for open-source & API LLMs
│   └── reporting/      # Empirical metrics & diagnostic logging
├── examples/           # End-to-end runnable scripts
├── tests/              # Rigorous mathematical property & integration tests
└── pyproject.toml      # Build metadata & dependency specifications
```

